    "verify_code": "import sympy as sp\ntheta_i = 35\ntheta_c = 38\n# Since theta_i < theta_c, total internal reflection does not occur; standard refraction from denser to rarer medium bends away from normal.\nanswer = 'B' if theta_i < theta_c else 'C'\nprint(answer)",
